      "content": "It is completely understandable to feel like the struggle is pointless when you feel stuck in a loop. Many people experience this deep weariness and question the purpose of effort. Your feelings are valid, but please remember that giving up is not the only option when you feel this way. If the usual resources feel inadequate, perhaps exploring different types of therapy or journaling might help you find a new perspective.",
      "source": "target",
